msgstr "Verbinde ein Modell, um mit dem Chatten zu beginnen"

#: src/Features/Playground/views/partial-model-chooser.php:37
msgid "One step, then this becomes your conversation."
msgstr "Ein Schritt noch, dann wird das hier deine Unterhaltung."

#: src/Features/Playground/views/partial-model-chooser.php:44
msgid "Let WordPress manage the model"
msgstr "Lass WordPress das Modell verwalten"

#: src/Features/Playground/views/partial-model-chooser.php:45
msgid "The recommended way — fewer steps now, nothing to maintain later."
msgstr "Der empfohlene Weg – jetzt weniger Schritte, später nichts zu pflegen."

#: src/Features/Playground/views/partial-model-chooser.php:50
msgid "One connection for the whole site — every AI plugin shares it instead of each asking for its own key."
msgstr "Eine Verbindung für die ganze Website – alle KI-Plugins teilen sie sich, statt jeweils einen eigenen Schlüssel zu verlangen."

#: src/Features/Playground/views/partial-model-chooser.php:51
msgid "The key stays with WordPress. This plugin never sees or stores it."
